{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1238833-orpheus-2e","id":1238833,"title":"Orpheus 2e","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-07-26T03:07:49-07:00","id":1238833,"title":"Orpheus 2e","content":"This might have come up here in the past, but I was just curious what people thought about the concept of a 2e Orpheus game?<br /> <br /> I know that the original was kind of a once-off experiment and had a very specific end game. But I was just thinking, what if there was a second run by of it, with updated 2e rules that (potentially) touches off of the ghost/underworld stuff we know about from the (incredible looking) upcoming GtSE 2e book. <br /> <br /> So you could still have Orpheus, Tyrell &amp; Squib (sp), etc. And still have the sequential crazy episode-books. But just have a slightly different background story/meta.<br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3192-baileyborough","name":"baileyborough","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T03:27:00-07:00","id":1238839,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3934-fetch\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3934_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3934\" data-vbnamecard=\"3934\">Fetch</a> did this awhile ago, though my link to the file seems dead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.co